     "line": "Veteran Services Intake Form",
     "position": "vrc",
     "window": [
      "To get started, please review the enrollment steps for new student veterans and dependents. Once you have completed the initial steps, we encourage you to schedule an appointment with our Veterans Counselor: Leanna Jack or Hideo Nakano-Hiraki by clicking this link: merritt.edu/counseling or calling (510) 436-2475. If you have questions about VA educational benefits, certification requirements, or how to use your benefits at Merritt College, please contact: Tina Humphrey, Veterans Affairs Coordinator / School Certifying Official (510) 436-2532 thumphrey@peralta.edu thumphrey@peralta.edu.",
      "We are here to support you throughout your academic journey and look forward to serving you at Merritt College.",
      "Start Your Application Process Here",
      "Veteran Services Intake Form",
      "Merritt Military Graduates",
      "Steps to Getting Started",
      "A. Have you signed up for Veterans Educational Benefits?"
